Realtime Excalidraw Clone

A realtime collaborative whiteboard inspired by Excalidraw, built with Next.js, TypeScript, WebSockets, and PostgreSQL.

## Features

- ✏️ Smooth freehand pencil drawing
- 🔍 Zoom in / zoom out
- ✋ Infinite canvas panning
- ♾️ Infinite canvas rendering
- ⚡ Low-latency realtime collaboration
- 👥 Multiplayer room support
- 🧠 WebSocket-based synchronization
- 💾 Persistent room state
- 🎨 Canvas rendering with viewport transforms
- ↩️ Undo / Redo support
- 🖱️ Selection and shape tools
- 📦 Monorepo architecture

---

# Tech Stack

## Frontend
- Next.js 15
- React 19
- TypeScript
- HTML5 Canvas API
- TailwindCSS

## Backend
- Node.js
- Express
- WebSockets (ws)

## Database
- PostgreSQL
- Prisma ORM

